      "value": "@{5fca5df4d58780532024a52b|full_name}: That's why i would suggest putting it in a config file so people can't randomly turn it on, but people who know what's going on can enable it.\nThe people who have it enabled will know that some avatars gonna be broken, so no problem with Display disparity there.\nAnd players that want to ensure that their avatars are display consistently for all users can stop using an unsupported type of animators.",
